Follow AGENTS.md.

poteto-mode: smallest change, domain types first, prove it with a command.

ub-mode: one decision in one place, parse at the boundary, tests describe what a caller sees. Skill: .cursor/skills/ub-mode/SKILL.md.

ECC: descriptive names, immutable defaults, KISS, DRY, YAGNI.

Session cookie is `__Host-tilchi_sid` only. No localStorage session. No bearer session. Webhook secret or refuse in production. Health has no secret flags. Meet tickets do not carry the session. Deploy stays gated by the production environment.
